[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Remove the flywheel side oil seal from\nits housing.</p>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the flywheel side oil seal (1a) using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.150.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013474.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flywhell side oil cover (1b)\nwith built in oil seal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013975.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>1. Fit the flywheel side oil cover with built-in oil seal  (1a)\nusing the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.619.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Tighten the bolts for the oil cover, flywheel side, to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FLYWHEEL SIDE COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8 - 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013976.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>Remove the tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.619.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and (1b), then remove the flywheel side oil\nseal cover (1c) with the built in oil seal.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Cut the sealant between the oil\nsump and the flywheel side oil seal cover.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014458.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Apply silicon sealant to the matching surfaces between\nthe oil sump and the flywheel side oil seal cover.</p><p>1. Place the flywheel side oil cover with the built-in oil seal\n (1a) back in its housing using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.619.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Tighten the bolts (2a) and (2b) securing the flywheel side oil\nseal cover to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT REAR COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 0.8 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Front and rear bolt</p></td><td><p>OIL SUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Flywheel oil seal cover side) 0.8 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014459.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237762\">1020D30</a></p>"]]